<th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">Quota / rate</th>
<th class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2 text-left">Best for</th>
</tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">Free Studio inference</td>
<td class="border border-gray-300 px-3 py-2">$0</td>
